    "name": "Rental Store Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3217050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/b07e7baf0de818baf8f2235ffc7953a7.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist customers by scanning movies, taking payments, and managing returns, to grow your retro video rental store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/b9603707fa8e9885e854dfc93afe7507.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which movies to sell, and place them within your store. As you progress you can unlock consoles, video players, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/0e2802c3fa6a06bf973a47bf0ccfc0cf.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep on top of it! Scrub graffiti, pick up trash, and sweep leaves to keep your store looking tidy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/37c472310e1ac1ee0ca078520ea9ad11.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/1653942bb72ab6e4109e1c90499251ea.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store, unlock more products, hire employees, attract more customers and boost your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/23471543ce95a7272be32d9c05751292.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/771d94efaaa127c0575f07e1e7a0cdd8.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a range of customization options and change the look and feel of your store. Find what suits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase movies, consoles, video players, and snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent them to customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process returns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle cash and card payments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/b07e7baf0de818baf8f2235ffc7953a7.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/a284a15296572369049a3ffbf7d41985.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist customers by scanning movies, taking payments, and managing returns, to grow your retro video rental store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/b9603707fa8e9885e854dfc93afe7507.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/ad5a466a669fc5a1905b4d7b596753e1.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which movies to sell, and place them within your store. As you progress you can unlock consoles, video players, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/0e2802c3fa6a06bf973a47bf0ccfc0cf.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.poster.avif?t=1740794734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.webm?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/97dcac0d869d16a9003ae1713b6ef867.mp4?t=1740794734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep on top of it! Scrub graffiti, pick up trash, and sweep leaves to keep your store looking tidy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/37c472310e1ac1ee0ca078520ea9ad11.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/1653942bb72ab6e4109e1c90499251ea.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store, unlock more products, hire employees, attract more customers and boost your business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/23471543ce95a7272be32d9c05751292.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=119 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3217050/extras/771d94efaaa127c0575f07e1e7a0cdd8.avif?t=1740794734\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a range of customization options and change the look and feel of your store. Find what suits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase movies, consoles, video players, and snacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rent them to customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process returns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean up the store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle cash and card payments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate</p></li></ul>",
